Package: quarantineRisk
Title: Calculate Border Quarantine Breach Risk
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yunhui", "Fan", , "yunhui.fan@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R package with an interactive Shiny app to explore how viral
    transmissibility and vaccine efficacy affect border quarantine breach risk,
    based on modelling results from Zachreson et al. (2022).
